<view
  class="page"
>
  <view
    class="guest-hero"
  >
    <view
      class="eyebrow"
    >拾光育苗 / 陪伴手册</view>
    <view
      class="title serif"
    >成长有迹，
心自成诗</view>
    <view
      class="intro-copy"
    >面向乡村留守儿童帮扶志愿者的 AI 陪伴助手。</view>
    <image
      class="landscape"
      src="/assets/landscape.svg"
      mode="aspectFill"
    />
    <view
      class="tag"
    >游客体验</view>
  </view>
  <view
    class="card section"
  >
    <view
      class="section-title"
    >让陪伴有线索，让成长被看见</view>
    <view
      class="body-copy"
    >以成长观察与陪伴记录为依据，帮助志愿者理解孩子的变化、准备陪伴活动，并把成长的片段写成诗。</view>
    <view
      class="small"
    >AI 建议仅供参考，非专业诊断。孩子档案与陪伴内容仅向获得授权的服务成员开放。</view>
  </view>
  <view
    class="section-head section"
  >
    <view
      class="section-title"
    >公开服务概况</view>
    <view
      class="small"
    >脱敏汇总</view>
  </view>
  <state-view
    status="{{status}}"
    title="{{status==='empty'?'服务数据尚在积累':''}}"
    message="{{error || '暂时没有公开统计，仍可了解项目或申请认证。'}}"
    actionText="{{status==='empty'?'邀请码认证':'重试'}}"
    bind:retry="load"
    bind:action="certify"
  />
  <view
    wx:if="{{status==='ready'}}"
    class="metric-grid"
  >
    <view
      class="card"
    >
      <view
        class="number"
      >{{overview.student_count}}</view>
      <view
        class="small"
      >孩子数</view>
    </view>
    <view
      class="card"
    >
      <view
        class="number"
      >{{overview.school_count}}</view>
      <view
        class="small"
      >学校数</view>
    </view>
    <view
      class="card"
    >
      <view
        class="number"
      >{{overview.record_count}}</view>
      <view
        class="small"
      >记录数</view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view
    wx:if="{{overview.suppressed}}"
    class="notice"
  >
    <image
      class="icon"
      src="/assets/icons/shield.svg"
    />
    <text>数据尚不足以公开。为保护隐私，成长评分与等级分布暂不展示。</text>
  </view>
  <view
    wx:if="{{sessionError}}"
    class="error-inline"
  >{{sessionError}}。仍可查看公开介绍与统计。</view>
  <view
    class="card section"
  >
    <view
      class="section-title"
    >成为陪伴的一员</view>
    <view
      class="body-copy"
    >向项目组织申请邀请码，完成认证后进入相应服务范围。</view>
    <button
      class="btn full"
      bindtap="certify"
    >输入邀请码认证</button>
  </view>
  <view
    class="version"
  >拾光育苗 · 成长有迹，心自成诗</view>
</view>
